ty in the requirements for lodging a Notice of Intention to export* > * *enable the Rules to provide guidance in relation to the approval of export permits* > * *enable the Rules to modify provisions of the 2020 Act and the Administrative Appeals Tribunal Act 1975 in relation to review of tariff rate quota certificate decisions and* > * *provide that the Rules may incorporate matters contained in agreements between Australia and other countries that relate to tariff rate quotas.*","result":"affirmative","slug":"division-federal-senate-6948","source_url":"https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/divisions/senate/2021-02-15/9"}
